1
00:00:00,668 --> 00:00:02,958
(Sheldon:)Leonard doesn't have time to chat.
He has to get the mail.

2
00:00:05,757 --> 00:00:07,507
(Leonard:)- Hey, how was work?
- Open the mail.

3
00:00:08,885 --> 00:00:10,175
(Leonard:)Excuse me.

4
00:00:17,811 --> 00:00:20,561
(Leonard:)A couple of circulars,
nothing important.

5
00:00:20,730 --> 00:00:23,400
- What's with him?
- Hang on.

6
00:00:33,910 --> 00:00:36,450
(Leonard:)You might be from Texas,
but I'm from New Jersey.

7
00:00:41,292 --> 00:00:46,002
(Leonard:)Check it out. Jim Lee drew this of me
two years ago at Comic-Con.

8
00:00:46,840 --> 00:00:49,510
- What are you wearing?
- Well, you know, it's Comic-Con.

9
00:00:52,262 --> 00:00:54,012
(Leonard:)I'm Lion-O from ThunderCats.

10
00:00:55,932 --> 00:00:58,012
(Alice:)Wow, you must have gotten so laid.

11
00:00:58,226 --> 00:01:04,026
Heh. No, but Jessica Alba
did rub my furry belly.

